---
source: crates/skif-edit/tests/package_json_format.rs
expression: "report(\"mixed-newlines-indent\")"
---
issues:
  - the top-level keys are not in the configured order
  - `keywords` is not sorted alphabetically
  - the layout differs from the configured indent
--- before
{\r\n
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": "mixed",\r\n
  "keywords": [
    "b",\r\n
    "a"
  ]\r\n
}
--- after
{\r\n
  "name": "mixed",\r\n
  "version": "1.0.0",\r\n
  "keywords": [\r\n
    "a",\r\n
    "b"\r\n
  ]\r\n
}\r\n
